0 PRODUCT PLOTTER - a passive geometric multiplier - ONE-PIN CONTROL
0 Name: product-plotter-decoupled.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/product-plotter.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub, two independent motors, five paired-rail sliders.
0 // Motor A tilts the yellow guide; Motor B sets the green rail X coordinate.
0 // Blue and orange readouts are passive actual intersections. No output pose is prescribed.
0 // All joints come from ordinary standard-part connections. No ground anchor or custom physics.
0 // Remove only p_swivel. Both separated followers remain on their own retained paired rails.
